    u['endocrine_timeline']['intro']='These stages show the order of care, not equal lengths of time. No dates or personal details are needed. Follow the prescribed tablet schedule between reviews; the treatment setting determines when it is reviewed or completed.'
    u['endocrine_timeline']['rows'][1]['text']='Confirm menopause, treatment setting, baseline bloods, medicines and bone-health plan'
